  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day14
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 14
  storyText: "Last night we heard scratching at the door. Not loud. Not urgent. Just...
    slow. Deliberate. Like something knew we were in here. We didn't move. Didn't
    breathe. The scratching stopped. Then started again. Closer to the floor this
    time. We looked at each other in the dark. No one spoke. After an hour, it stopped.
    This morning, we checked the door from the window \u2014 couldn't see anything.
    But the smell. There's a smell now. Sweet. Rotten. Wrong. It's coming from the
    hallway. We don't open the door anymore. Not for anything.\r"
